Centralized Log Monitoring with Grafana Alloy, Loki & Grafana


- Loki → logs: application logs, system logs, container logs.
- Grafana → visualization: dashboards that combine Prometheus metrics and Loki logs.
- Promtail / Grafana Alloy → log collection: reads logs and sends them to Loki.

